# Poisons for Alliance Rogues: Mathias and the Defias (2360) and Klaven's
# Tower (2359) from Master Mathias Shaw to Agent Kearnen on the Westfall side
# of the Duskwood border and back, then the follow-up The Touch of Zanzil
# (2607, 2608, 2609) with Doc Mixilpixil in the SI:7 cellar.
# Forever change (Forever's Rogue class quest list,
# data/local/quest-audit/): Klaven's Tower now
# teaches Poisons (Forever moved it from the trainer onto this quest).
# Rewards from the same list:
# Recipe: Thistle Tea (Klaven's Tower), Eau de Mixilpixil (The Touch of
# Zanzil, 2609). Forever's quest data files Klaven's Tower as a group quest.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers,
# drops, vendors and places.
# alliance/04-redridge-mountains and alliance/05-duskwood do 2360 and 2359 on
# the route; this guide repeats them for anyone off it and adds The Touch of
# Zanzil.

step Mathias and the Defias
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 20 Master Mathias Shaw at SI:7 in Old Town sends you to Agent Kearnen in Westfall.
  level 20
  accept 2360                                 -- Master Mathias Shaw

step Agent Kearnen
  zone Westfall
  tip Agent Kearnen watches Klaven Mortwake's tower from the hills in the far east of Westfall, by the Duskwood border. The Malformed Defias Drone (level 23) guarding the tower carries its key; Klaven's journal is in the chest at the top.
  turnin 2360                                 -- Agent Kearnen
  accept 2359
  collect 7923 quest 2359.2                   -- Defias Tower Key: Malformed Defias Drone
  collect 7908 quest 2359.1                   -- Klaven Mortwake's Journal, in the Duskwood Chest

step Master Mathias Shaw
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Head north through Elwynn to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town.
  turnin 2359 reward 18160                    -- Master Mathias Shaw: Poisons
  accept 2607

step Doc Mixilpixil
  tip Doc Mixilpixil works in the cellar of SI:7, the Barracks. Type /lay down beside him to be examined.
  turnin 2607                                 -- Doc Mixilpixil
  accept 2608
  complete 2608                               -- /lay down
  turnin 2608
  accept 2609

step The cure's ingredients
  tip Everything is in Stormwind: the Gumps sell Simple Wildflowers, the Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread lies in the city, and the nearest vendors sell a Leaded Vial and a Bronze Tube.
  buy 3421 x1 nearest                         -- Simple Wildflowers
  buy 3372 x1 nearest                         -- Leaded Vial
  buy 4371 x1 nearest                         -- Bronze Tube
  collect 8431 quest 2609.4                   -- Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread

step Back to Doc Mixilpixil
  turnin 2609 reward 8432                     -- Doc Mixilpixil: Eau de Mixilpixil
